      "content": "Even a small amount of excess iron can cause side effects if it builds up in the body, which is why careful dosing is essential. Iron overload can lead to serious health issues, not just temporary fatigue relief. It is very important to wait for specific dosing instructions from a healthcare professional before changing the prescribed amount. Please call the doctor's office or a pharmacist to clarify the recommended dosage before giving him any more supplements.",
