      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While iron is vital, suddenly doubling the dose for ten days could still expose him to unnecessary iron overload. The risk isn't just that it's \"more iron\"; it can affect his digestive system and organs if taken too quickly. It is safest to follow the exact instructions provided by the medical team to ensure the treatment is both effective and safe for him. Please reach out to a nurse line or pharmacist for immediate guidance regarding the dosage.",
